              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pretopos"} pretopos
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Grothendieck+topos"} Grothendieck topos
            can be nicely unified in a theory of “familial regularity and exactness.” This was apparently first noticed in
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "#Street"} Street 1984
            %a{:href => "#Shulman"} Shulman 2012
            with a generalized theory of
            = succeed "." do
